          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घड़ी (ghaṛī) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from ghaṭī, \"pot, water-clock\" (CDIAL 4406). A ghaṭī was a small pot that sank as it filled, timing a short period."
